  vignettes:
  - image: {fileID: 75755818, guid: 3005a11dba33d9542a3c90bd1d1190d2, type: 3}
    text: You arrive at a kind of swamp, damp and murky, watery areas and mudflats
      appear before you.
  - image: {fileID: 1781549058, guid: 3005a11dba33d9542a3c90bd1d1190d2, type: 3}
    text: "It is inhabited by evil creatures called \u2018Maligores\u2019, who seem
      to be the reincarnation of hatred and gloom."
  - image: {fileID: -1776100737, guid: 3005a11dba33d9542a3c90bd1d1190d2, type: 3}
    text: You need to get to the wise men's hut, located at the top of the hill,
      to find a solution to the problem.
  - image: {fileID: -70268668, guid: 3005a11dba33d9542a3c90bd1d1190d2, type: 3}
    text: To get there, you will need to help the local people by overcoming three
      trials, the maze of hunger, the river of refugees and the hill of inequalities.
  nextButtonText: Next
